      215.27
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE AYESHAH EDUCATION TRUST",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.25,
      401.89,
      291.47
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an organization called and known as the\u201cAyeshah Education Trust \u201d has heretofore been formed inSri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with the saidorganization according to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      305.45,
      401.9,
      367.67
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      381.65,
      401.89,
      405.71
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      419.81,
      401.89,
      443.87
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Ayeshah Education Trust(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      457.85,
      401.93,
      583.55
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theAyeshah Education Trust (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cOrganization\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as membersof the Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a bodycorporate with perpetual succession under the name and styleof the \u201cAyeshah Education Trust\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued,with full power and authority to have and use a commonseal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      597.53,
      401.87,
      621.59
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      635.69,
      401.93,
      672.47
    ],
    "text": "(a)to provide tertiary level education social sciences,Islamic Theological studies with special focus onmotherhood development;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      458.11,
      455.86,
      505.58
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof theAyeshahEducationTrust.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      598.39,
      454.3,
      626.66
    ],
    "text": "Generalobjects of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
