      172.87,
      202.97,
      397.16,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide short term courses on womenempowerment and family development;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      238.97,
      395.63,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)to develop skills and leadership qualities of girls;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      262.97,
      397.18,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)to conduct and hold seminars, conferences,workshops, discussions, debates, art exhibitions andsimilar activities for the purpose of promotingknowledge and the arts;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      322.97,
      397.2,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "(e)to collect, classify, print, publish and distributebooks, journals, and magazines;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      358.97,
      397.19,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "(f)to promote, encourage, assist and foster activitiesfor the advancement of communal, national andinternational understanding, religious harmony,goodwill and peace amongst the people;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      418.97,
      397.2,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "(g)to be a coaching centre for the General Cerificate ofEducation (Advanced Level) Examination;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      454.97,
      397.19,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(h)to provide vocational courses for females in anyindustry or trade using raw materials available inthe area; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      502.97,
      397.19,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)to do all such acts and things not inconsistent withthe provisions of any other written law as are, in theopinion of the Council of Management, conduciveto furtherance of the above objectives.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      562.97,
      397.2,
      610.31
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subjectto the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,be administered by a Board of Management elected inaccordance with the rules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      622.97,
      397.18,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall consist of the members of the Board of Management ofthe Organization holding office on the day preceding thedate of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
